        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>Most infrastructure projects fail at the handoffs — between consultant and integrator, between integrator and operator, between vendor and client. Our four-stage framework eliminates those handoffs because the same team owns every stage.</p>
          <p>The team that assesses your environment designs the solution. The team that designs it builds it. The team that builds it operates it. That continuity means fewer surprises, faster resolution, and infrastructure that actually works the way it was drawn.</p>
